{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"2TI","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"提摩太後書","commonName":"提摩太後書","title":"提摩太後書","order":55,"numberOfChapters":4,"sha256":"477cf87374df21b851bfdf189da6c4b0e715a9c23d8660f31ac2316ba2fb5823","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/2TI/1.json","lastChapterNumber":4,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/2TI/4.json","totalNumberOfVerses":83},"chapter":{"number":3,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["末世的情形"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["你要知道，末世必有艱難的日子，"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["因為那時的人都自私自利、貪愛錢財、狂妄自誇、驕傲自負、譭謗褻瀆、違背父母、忘恩負義、心不聖潔、"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["冷漠無情、不願和解、好說讒言、毫無節制、蠻橫兇暴、不愛良善、"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["出賣朋友、任意妄為、自高自大、沉溺享樂、不愛上帝，"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["徒有敬虔的外表，卻無敬虔的實質。你要避開這樣的人。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["這些人溜進別人家裡，哄騙那些意志薄弱的婦女。那些婦女心中充滿罪惡，受各種邪情私慾驅使，"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["雖然常常學習，卻始終不能明白真理。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["現在這些人敵對真理，就像從前雅尼和佯庇反對摩西一樣，他們的心思壞透了，他們的信仰是虛假的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["不過，他們猖狂不了多久，因為他們的愚昧行徑必暴露在眾人面前，就像雅尼和佯庇的下場一樣。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["聖經的益處"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["但你熟知我的教導、言行、志向、信心、忍耐、愛心、毅力，"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["也知道我在安提阿、以哥念、路司得遭遇了何等的迫害和苦難。但主從這一切患難中救了我。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["其實凡立志在基督耶穌裡過敬虔生活的人都會受到迫害。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["而惡人和騙子會變本加厲地作惡，迷惑人，也被人迷惑。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["但你要堅守自己所學所信的，因為你知道是跟誰學的，"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["並且你從小就熟悉聖經。聖經能給你智慧，使你藉著信基督耶穌而得救。"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["聖經全部是上帝啟示的，有益於教導、督責、使人歸正、培養人行義，"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["使屬上帝的人得到充分的裝備，去行各種善事。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/2TI/3.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/2TI/4.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/2TI/2.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":17}